        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. Employees hired prior to May 4, 1997 shall be paid in accordance with the salary schedules provided in Appendices A-1 through A-2 of this Agreement. Said employees shall be converted to the salary schedule provided in Appendix B-1 of this Agreement as follows:",
