            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Employees who, as of June 29, 1999, were paid at Step 7 on the salary schedule provided in Appendix A-1 shall, effective June 30, 1999, be paid at a salary rate on the salary schedule provided in Appendix B-1 equal to that which the employee received on the salary schedule provided in Appendix A-1. For the purposes outlined in Section 4 of this Article, said employees shall, upon conversion to the salary schedule provided in Appendix B-1, be provided with a date of next step increase in the next fiscal year which corresponds to the month and day on which the employee received his/her most recent step rate increase.",
